@@ -0,0 +1,66 @@
+Static table, from the spec:
+          +-------+-----------------------------+---------------+
+          | Index | Header Name                 | Header Value  |
+          +-------+-----------------------------+---------------+
+          | 1     | :authority                  |               |
+          | 2     | :method                     | GET           |
+          | 3     | :method                     | POST          |
+          | 4     | :path                       | /             |
+          | 5     | :path                       | /index.html   |
